# Client Communication Templates

This file provides standardized templates for client communications, ensuring the 4-hour response commitment and venue-specific approach.

## Initial Acknowledgment (Send within 1 hour)

### Email Template

```
Subject: Received: Your [club|lounge|bar|residential] inquiry - Response coming soon

Dear [Client Name],

Thank you for reaching out to cFish.io about your [specific venue type/project].

I've received your inquiry and am reviewing the details. You'll receive a complete response with relevant examples within [X] hours (maximum 4 hours).

For urgent matters, you can reach me directly at [phone number].

Best regards,

[Your Name]
[Your Title]
cFish.io
[Contact Information]
```

### Text/Message Template

```
Hi [Client Name], thank you for contacting cFish.io about your [venue type/project]. I've received your inquiry and will send a complete response within [X] hours (max 4). Looking forward to discussing your [club|lounge|bar|residential] needs soon.
```

