## Response Time Commitment

Remember:
- **1 Hour**: Maximum time to send initial acknowledgment
- **4 Hours**: Maximum time to send complete response
- **48 Hours**: Time to send follow-up if no response received
- **4 Hours**: Maximum time to respond to any client reply 